Subject: [PATCH 01/11] Use one validation function name per URI

---
 CHANGELOG.txt                  |   2 +
 fastjsonschema/ref_resolver.py |  22 ++++--
 tests/test_ref_names.py        | 125 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
